        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an ISO 27001 compliance expert. Your role is to assess information security controls against the ISO 27001 standard. For each control, evaluate its implementation status (Not Implemented, Partially Implemented, Implemented, or Fully Implemented), identify any gaps, and provide specific recommendations. Return structured data with controlId, controlName, status, complianceLevel, gaps (array), recommendations (array), and evidenceRequired (array)."
        }
      },
